WEBVTT

00:00.760 --> 00:03.560
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.560 --> 00:06.150
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.820 --> 00:10.220
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.920 --> 00:14.930
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.300 --> 00:17.830
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:18.170 --> 00:21.610
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.360 --> 00:28.580
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.260 --> 00:34.340
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:35.140 --> 00:37.630
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.630 --> 00:40.240
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.760 --> 00:48.020
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.990 --> 00:51.750
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.810 --> 00:54.650
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.940 --> 00:55.970
♪Let me♪

00:56.160 --> 01:00.240
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.690 --> 01:03.370
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.660 --> 01:06.360
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.530 --> 01:08.000
♪Hands held tight♪

01:08.000 --> 01:12.170
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.530 --> 01:22.780
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:24.210 --> 01:29.760
=Legend of The Female General=

01:29.960 --> 01:32.840
=Episode 14=

01:33.670 --> 01:34.670
I'm just puzzled

01:35.550 --> 01:37.229
why you haven't joined the Xiao Army.

01:44.750 --> 01:45.990
You're not young anymore.

01:46.750 --> 01:47.789
Retiring from battle

01:48.270 --> 01:49.479
is understandable.

01:50.470 --> 01:51.780
I'm no deserter.

02:00.870 --> 02:02.270
(Xiao)
This was my son's dagger.

02:07.190 --> 02:08.150
I was indeed once

02:08.190 --> 02:09.310
a member of the Xiao Army.

02:12.750 --> 02:13.950
But Xiao Zhongwu

02:15.190 --> 02:17.350
caused my only son's tragic death,

02:17.950 --> 02:19.750
and my wife died of grief.

02:20.710 --> 02:22.910
I swore before their memorial tablets

02:25.150 --> 02:26.590
that I'd make the Xiao family

02:28.420 --> 02:29.750
suffer complete ruin.

02:31.550 --> 02:33.310
So you've been tracking the Xiao Army.

02:34.950 --> 02:35.590
Exactly.

02:38.670 --> 02:40.390
The son shall pay for
the father's debts.

02:41.390 --> 02:43.310
I followed from Yaojing to Que City

02:43.790 --> 02:45.590
to seek revenge against Xiao Jue.

02:47.110 --> 02:47.870
But I never

02:47.870 --> 02:49.230
found the right opportunity.

02:52.829 --> 02:53.510
Perhaps

02:54.590 --> 02:56.350
you'll get your chance soon.

02:59.550 --> 03:00.830
His greatest value lies in

03:01.190 --> 03:02.230
his knowledge of Xiao Jue

03:02.350 --> 03:03.910
and the Xiao Army.

03:04.790 --> 03:05.510
As for Lei Hou,

03:05.830 --> 03:07.110
he makes a convenient weapon.

03:08.110 --> 03:09.270
Rida Muzi and Hu Yuanzhong,

03:09.270 --> 03:10.910
these Liehe men are ambitious wolves

03:11.230 --> 03:12.390
(Strong Strength)
with strong military forces.

03:13.470 --> 03:14.710
I leaked information about them

03:14.750 --> 03:15.590
to him.

03:16.350 --> 03:17.590
He didn't disappoint me.

03:18.070 --> 03:18.829
He made Lei Hou

03:19.030 --> 03:20.390
collaborate with the Liehe tribe

03:20.870 --> 03:21.829
to attack the garrison.

03:22.310 --> 03:24.310
A good utilization.

03:25.870 --> 03:27.390
Who is this person?

03:28.190 --> 03:29.390
His name is Chai Anxi.

03:30.110 --> 03:31.630
He was once Xiao Zhongwu's deputy.

03:32.790 --> 03:34.550
Wasn't he supposed to be dead?

03:35.030 --> 03:36.870
Apart from the Xiao Army matters,

03:37.310 --> 03:38.590
what else did he mention?

03:39.990 --> 03:41.950
Did he say anything about Mingshui?

03:50.190 --> 03:52.230
This man's resurrection

03:52.590 --> 03:54.030
is quite suspicious.

03:54.870 --> 03:57.829
Don't get yourself
involved in this mess.

03:59.470 --> 04:00.550
Thank you for the reminder.

04:01.950 --> 04:02.790
Chai Anxi and I

04:03.150 --> 04:04.110
only met once.

04:04.310 --> 04:05.630
I soon returned to the capital.

04:05.870 --> 04:07.190
Later, we communicated by letters

04:07.630 --> 04:08.630
until Lei Hou's defeat.

04:08.990 --> 04:09.910
Our contact stopped.

04:10.550 --> 04:11.670
Is that all?

04:12.830 --> 04:13.550
I won't

04:14.350 --> 04:15.270
conceal anything.

04:17.269 --> 04:17.870
Forget it.

04:18.790 --> 04:20.950
Clean up this mess.

04:21.070 --> 04:22.470
Whether it's Lei Hou

04:22.830 --> 04:24.350
or Chai Anxi,

04:24.990 --> 04:26.310
eliminate them both.

04:27.710 --> 04:28.470
As you command.

04:29.950 --> 04:31.070
But the clues

04:31.110 --> 04:32.230
about Chai Anxi and Lei Hou

04:32.790 --> 04:33.870
point to Xiao Jue.

04:35.510 --> 04:36.550
Seems I'll have to go

04:36.550 --> 04:37.350
to Yezhou Garrison.

04:38.180 --> 04:39.790
What pretext will you use?

04:42.750 --> 04:44.670
Commander Xiao fought this battle well.

04:46.190 --> 04:47.430
He deserves rewards.

05:14.470 --> 05:15.910
I underestimated Xiao Jue.

05:16.590 --> 05:19.030
He's more cunning than imagined.

05:20.550 --> 05:21.110
Also,

05:21.870 --> 05:22.630
prepare two corpses

05:22.830 --> 05:23.510
similar in build

05:23.550 --> 05:24.750
to Lei Hou.

05:25.510 --> 05:26.630
Since I promised Master,

05:27.230 --> 05:28.030
I must do it.

05:28.550 --> 05:29.070
Understood.

05:30.310 --> 05:31.430
Master's wording suggests

05:31.710 --> 05:33.310
he's clearly wary of Chai Anxi.

05:33.710 --> 05:34.470
Likely

05:35.390 --> 05:36.310
Chai Anxi

05:36.310 --> 05:37.390
has dirt on Master.

05:39.550 --> 05:40.390
I'm curious

05:41.430 --> 05:42.270
what kind of secret

05:42.310 --> 05:43.950
this could be.

05:47.820 --> 05:51.080
(Xiao)

05:56.950 --> 05:57.550
Commander.

05:58.070 --> 05:59.150
Are you available now?

06:01.070 --> 06:01.630
Enter.

06:29.870 --> 06:30.390
Commander.

06:31.270 --> 06:32.030
It's repaired?

06:34.390 --> 06:36.030
I said I'd thank you.

06:39.630 --> 06:40.670
Are you sure it's thanks,

06:41.390 --> 06:42.110
not an apology?

06:44.590 --> 06:46.310
They're basically the same.

06:46.830 --> 06:47.790
When you have time,

06:48.190 --> 06:49.190
you can test its tone.

06:50.270 --> 06:51.230
Then I'll go train now.

07:01.550 --> 07:02.150
I heard

07:02.630 --> 07:04.110
he spent the pay he saved

07:04.510 --> 07:05.870
over these months on this qin.

07:53.230 --> 07:54.270
- The envoy!
- The envoy!

07:54.390 --> 07:55.430
- The envoy!
- The envoy!

07:56.870 --> 07:57.710
- Wait!
- Hurry!

08:12.030 --> 08:12.630
Sir.

08:22.390 --> 08:23.110
Chu Zhao.

08:30.270 --> 08:30.790
Sir.

08:37.870 --> 08:38.750
Commander

08:38.990 --> 08:39.669
Xiao Jue

08:39.830 --> 08:40.669
is an expert trainer

08:40.950 --> 08:42.309
and performed well against Liehe.

08:42.710 --> 08:43.710
I'm pleased to grant him

08:44.030 --> 08:44.950
a large sum of money

08:45.310 --> 08:46.390
as a mark of honor.

08:47.870 --> 08:49.030
Thank you, Your Majesty.

09:03.110 --> 09:04.910
You must be weary from your journey.

09:05.470 --> 09:06.830
I've arranged quarters for you.

09:07.350 --> 09:08.150
Let Feinu

09:08.390 --> 09:09.270
take you there.

09:10.470 --> 09:11.230
Thank you.

09:11.790 --> 09:12.590
Please take

09:13.390 --> 09:14.710
my maidservant there first.

09:15.830 --> 09:17.430
Earlier, I encountered an acquaintance.

09:17.830 --> 09:18.710
I want to see him.

09:19.390 --> 09:20.030
Then

09:20.590 --> 09:21.510
I'll leave you to it.

09:24.030 --> 09:25.350
Mr. Chu, you're too generous.

09:25.990 --> 09:26.830
You came here.

09:27.670 --> 09:28.390
It should be

09:28.510 --> 09:30.190
my duty to play host.

09:30.550 --> 09:31.630
I hope this simple meal

09:32.110 --> 09:33.230
suits your taste.

09:33.550 --> 09:34.070
Please.

09:37.830 --> 09:38.590
Mr. He.

09:39.590 --> 09:40.190
Thank you.

09:42.350 --> 09:43.150
Word reached

09:43.310 --> 09:45.070
the capital that a Yezhou recruit

09:45.710 --> 09:46.990
crushed Liehe's spirit.

09:47.390 --> 09:48.030
I knew

09:48.190 --> 09:48.910
it must be you,

09:49.390 --> 09:50.510
so I took this assignment

09:50.870 --> 09:51.710
to visit you.

09:52.390 --> 09:53.030
By the way,

09:53.470 --> 09:54.950
I heard you suffered severe injuries.

09:55.230 --> 09:55.950
How are you now?

09:56.950 --> 09:58.470
Thank you for your concern.

09:58.550 --> 09:59.070
I'm strong.

09:59.430 --> 09:59.990
I'm fine now.

10:08.790 --> 10:09.310
Mr. Chu,

10:09.990 --> 10:11.550
you came from the capital.

10:11.670 --> 10:12.590
Have there been

10:12.630 --> 10:13.670
any interesting things

10:13.750 --> 10:14.790
lately in the capital?

10:15.550 --> 10:16.790
Interesting things?

10:25.590 --> 10:26.120
Mr. Chu?

10:27.070 --> 10:27.590
What is it?

10:29.430 --> 10:29.960
Nothing.

10:34.910 --> 10:35.550
Mr. He,

10:35.950 --> 10:37.830
what kind of things
are you referring to?

10:40.230 --> 10:40.830
Mr. Chu,

10:41.110 --> 10:42.070
I hear

10:42.390 --> 10:43.950
there's someone in the capital

10:43.950 --> 10:45.870
as renowned as the Commander,
General Feihong.

10:46.510 --> 10:47.270
Tell me,

10:47.510 --> 10:48.510
what kind of person

10:48.990 --> 10:49.950
is General Feihong?

10:51.310 --> 10:53.030
You ask the wrong person.

10:53.670 --> 10:54.550
I live in the capital,

10:54.990 --> 10:56.070
but I'm a civil official.

10:56.390 --> 10:57.270
I'm not acquainted

10:57.670 --> 10:58.390
with him.

11:02.830 --> 11:04.230
Then has anything unusual

11:04.750 --> 11:06.470
occurred recently

11:06.790 --> 11:08.070
in the general's house?

11:09.830 --> 11:11.750
Unusual?

11:14.270 --> 11:16.350
General Feihong stopped

11:16.510 --> 11:17.270
wearing his mask,

11:17.270 --> 11:18.270
revealing his true face.

11:21.870 --> 11:23.270
He's peerless in martial arts,

11:23.670 --> 11:24.270
and he is also

11:24.430 --> 11:25.590
strikingly handsome.

11:25.710 --> 11:26.590
Of course.

11:26.870 --> 11:27.710
The stature

11:27.790 --> 11:28.590
of our young master

11:28.590 --> 11:29.390
is more imposing.

11:29.830 --> 11:30.990
It's just the Mingshui Battle

11:31.150 --> 11:32.150
weakened him,

11:32.630 --> 11:34.230
forcing him to recuperate at home

11:34.270 --> 11:35.150
and decline visitors

11:35.390 --> 11:36.510
and keeping him

11:36.790 --> 11:37.910
from greater feats.

11:41.990 --> 11:42.510
Get out!

11:48.470 --> 11:48.990
Rufei.

11:49.350 --> 11:51.590
Why this outburst?

11:52.350 --> 11:53.870
She's already dead.

11:54.510 --> 11:57.070
Why does she still haunt me?

11:57.790 --> 11:59.550
I am clearly He Rufei.

12:00.070 --> 12:02.230
I am the true General Feihong.

12:10.830 --> 12:12.030
General Feihong

12:12.350 --> 12:13.510
is truly loyal and devoted.

12:13.710 --> 12:14.670
He's a good brother.

12:15.150 --> 12:16.830
He often visits
the Yuhua Temple to light

12:17.150 --> 12:18.630
eternal lamps for his dead sister.

12:23.590 --> 12:25.150
How loyal and devoted

12:25.150 --> 12:26.230
General Feihong is.

12:29.870 --> 12:31.950
Mr. He, why are you so interested

12:32.030 --> 12:32.950
in General Feihong?

12:36.430 --> 12:38.150
He is a role model for our generation,

12:38.550 --> 12:39.630
so I admire him.

12:41.790 --> 12:43.660
Though you serve under Commander Xiao,

12:43.830 --> 12:45.390
you admire General Feihong.

12:45.790 --> 12:46.390
Don't you think

12:46.590 --> 12:48.030
Commander Xiao might feel displeased

12:48.110 --> 12:48.710
if he knows?

12:50.270 --> 12:51.150
Our commander

12:51.350 --> 12:52.070
is magnanimous.

12:53.790 --> 12:55.190
Then let me toast you

12:55.630 --> 12:56.470
with this wine.

13:04.750 --> 13:05.630
Mr. He.

13:05.640 --> 13:06.300
Yeah.

13:20.710 --> 13:21.230
Huaijin,

13:21.710 --> 13:22.600
where did

13:22.600 --> 13:23.150
Miss He go?

13:24.870 --> 13:26.030
She's drinking with Chu Zhao.

13:26.790 --> 13:27.510
You know it?

13:28.750 --> 13:30.550
I didn't expect you to care so much

13:30.670 --> 13:31.750
about Miss He.

13:35.430 --> 13:36.070
Listen, Huaijin,

13:36.630 --> 13:37.790
that's Chu Zhao!

13:38.390 --> 13:39.550
Aren't you worried at all?

13:41.350 --> 13:42.190
Is he that awesome?

13:44.390 --> 13:45.510
Although Chu Zhao

13:45.510 --> 13:47.030
serves under Xu Jingfu,

13:47.430 --> 13:48.430
objectively speaking,

13:48.990 --> 13:50.750
he's truly talented

13:51.190 --> 13:52.590
and gentlemanly.

13:52.870 --> 13:53.750
Miss He

13:53.950 --> 13:55.270
usually encounters burly men

13:55.430 --> 13:57.030
in the military camp.

13:57.670 --> 13:59.590
Though someone is decent-looking,

14:02.990 --> 14:03.510
he is

14:03.550 --> 14:05.270
expressionless all day.

14:06.230 --> 14:07.190
In my opinion,

14:07.510 --> 14:08.390
Miss He might

14:09.030 --> 14:11.110
get snatched away

14:11.150 --> 14:12.270
by that heartthrob Chu Zhao.

14:18.430 --> 14:18.950
What?

14:19.430 --> 14:20.390
Going to see Miss He?

14:22.310 --> 14:23.150
Don't block my light.

14:25.580 --> 14:26.150
Fine, fine.

14:26.310 --> 14:27.750
Keep pretending to be indifferent.

14:47.070 --> 14:48.620
Mr. Chu.

14:49.060 --> 14:49.710
Yeah.

14:50.190 --> 14:51.390
People say

14:52.150 --> 14:53.670
blood ties

14:53.790 --> 14:55.190
are the hardest to sever.

14:56.630 --> 14:57.910
Do you think

14:58.270 --> 14:59.230
that's true?

15:02.270 --> 15:03.150
If that's true,

15:03.470 --> 15:04.190
why do we

15:04.590 --> 15:05.830
even have

15:05.950 --> 15:07.350
a story like Cain and Abel?

15:11.110 --> 15:11.710
(Mother,)

15:12.030 --> 15:13.510
(I learned a new song.)

15:13.630 --> 15:14.550
Let me sing it for you.

15:16.990 --> 15:18.190
Little birds fly,

15:18.430 --> 15:19.710
streams giggle,

15:19.850 --> 15:21.670
- fish chase...
- Who let you in?

15:25.270 --> 15:25.830
Father.

15:26.710 --> 15:27.990
I finished my studies.

15:28.270 --> 15:29.950
Today is Mother's birthday.

15:30.070 --> 15:31.830
I just wanted to celebrate her.

15:33.430 --> 15:35.150
As the He family's eldest son,

15:35.670 --> 15:37.070
don't indulge in feminine affairs.

15:37.510 --> 15:39.030
Have you memorized

15:39.430 --> 15:40.270
the Virtue chapter?

15:41.150 --> 15:42.550
A nobleman's virtue

15:43.230 --> 15:44.350
requires utmost sincerity,

15:44.670 --> 15:45.630
righteousness,

15:46.630 --> 15:47.390
and...

15:48.030 --> 15:48.630
and...

15:48.790 --> 15:49.670
Recite like this

15:49.830 --> 15:51.110
and claim your studies are done?

15:51.390 --> 15:52.110
Useless!

16:04.150 --> 16:04.750
Mr. He,

16:07.030 --> 16:08.870
this song should be light and cheerful,

16:09.270 --> 16:09.990
but your rendition

16:10.510 --> 16:11.630
sounds so sorrowful.

16:16.190 --> 16:18.250
You've heard this song, too?

16:19.550 --> 16:20.190
Long ago,

16:21.230 --> 16:22.590
my mother often hummed it.

16:25.510 --> 16:27.150
My poor execution

16:27.990 --> 16:29.750
fails to capture

16:30.030 --> 16:32.070
its carefree essence.

16:32.590 --> 16:33.270
Mr. Chu, cheers.

16:33.430 --> 16:34.310
Let's drink.

16:41.830 --> 16:42.350
Come on.

16:42.870 --> 16:43.670
Let's keep drinking.

16:46.910 --> 16:47.430
Mr. He.

16:47.870 --> 16:48.460
He...

16:52.270 --> 16:53.630
You were born free-spirited.

16:53.870 --> 16:55.510
Why do you say such despondent words?

16:56.710 --> 16:57.790
If something troubles you,

16:59.070 --> 17:00.550
I'll be here to listen.

17:02.270 --> 17:03.110
Mr. Chu.

17:03.550 --> 17:04.869
Why would you say that?

17:11.980 --> 17:12.790
I...

17:13.750 --> 17:14.510
He Yan.

17:15.829 --> 17:17.190
I am He Yan.

17:18.310 --> 17:19.390
I was born

17:19.430 --> 17:20.589
to roam free in vast seas

17:20.869 --> 17:22.510
and soar across endless skies.

17:23.230 --> 17:24.910
No longer confined by cages.

17:33.030 --> 17:33.540
Come on.

17:33.870 --> 17:34.470
Mr. Chu.

17:38.910 --> 17:39.550
Mr. Chu.

17:40.110 --> 17:40.910
I hear

17:41.630 --> 17:42.950
near Yezhou Garrison

17:43.230 --> 17:44.430
lies Mount Baiyue.

17:44.870 --> 17:46.790
Its scenery is breathtaking.

17:47.070 --> 17:47.590
Come on!

17:47.830 --> 17:49.110
Let's drink wine together

17:49.110 --> 17:50.110
while admiring the moon.

17:50.190 --> 17:50.790
Mr. He.

17:50.790 --> 17:51.340
Let's go.

17:51.470 --> 17:52.270
You're drunk.

17:52.270 --> 17:52.990
Let's go back.

17:53.150 --> 17:53.670
Mount Baiyue

17:53.870 --> 17:54.870
won't go anywhere.

17:55.630 --> 17:56.590
Mr. Chu.

17:56.630 --> 17:58.030
I'm not drunk.

17:58.350 --> 17:58.950
Come on!

17:59.310 --> 17:59.910
Mr. He.

18:06.230 --> 18:06.870
Commander Xiao.

18:07.750 --> 18:08.390
Perfect timing.

18:08.830 --> 18:09.710
Mr. He and I are going

18:09.750 --> 18:11.390
to Mount Baiyue
to drink in the moonlight.

18:12.110 --> 18:12.870
Care to join us?

18:14.230 --> 18:14.790
Right.

18:15.230 --> 18:16.150
To Mount Baiyue.

18:16.200 --> 18:16.870
I...

18:27.350 --> 18:28.420
Mr. Chu, if you want,

18:28.750 --> 18:29.510
you may go alone.

18:30.270 --> 18:30.990
I'll take He Yan

18:32.470 --> 18:33.350
back to sober up.

18:35.990 --> 18:37.190
Where are we going?

18:37.390 --> 18:39.690
I want to go
to Mount Baiyue for a drink.

18:41.710 --> 18:42.910
Put me down.

18:50.590 --> 18:51.140
This...

18:51.430 --> 18:52.620
Where am I?

18:53.190 --> 18:54.150
Let me go!

18:54.190 --> 18:56.310
I want to see the moon at Mount Baiyue!

18:59.980 --> 19:02.190
Not drunk yet. I can still drink.

19:04.630 --> 19:05.470
Mr. Chu.

19:05.590 --> 19:06.230
Come on.

19:06.510 --> 19:07.230
Drink.

19:07.630 --> 19:08.670
Here, drink up.

19:17.110 --> 19:18.670
You and Chu Zhao get along well.

19:20.630 --> 19:21.190
Right.

19:21.750 --> 19:22.350
I...

19:22.750 --> 19:24.360
I want to see the moon.

19:24.360 --> 19:26.870
I want to see the moon.

19:28.390 --> 19:29.070
More wine here.

19:42.750 --> 19:43.270
Uncle,

19:43.270 --> 19:44.830
I knew you'd go to snatch her away.

19:45.230 --> 19:45.910
This...

19:45.910 --> 19:46.430
Give me.

19:56.870 --> 19:57.420
Huaijin,

19:57.670 --> 19:58.590
you can't even

19:58.670 --> 19:59.230
pull her away

19:59.310 --> 20:00.390
when she's drunk?

20:00.750 --> 20:02.070
Is it her injuries

20:02.350 --> 20:03.270
holding you back?

20:06.750 --> 20:08.030
You don't let me drink

20:08.510 --> 20:10.670
because I can't recite
the Virtue chapter?

20:14.510 --> 20:15.230
Father.

20:15.750 --> 20:16.910
I can recite it.

20:17.510 --> 20:18.030
Father?

20:18.190 --> 20:18.870
How exciting!

20:23.790 --> 20:24.630
What did you call me?

20:26.030 --> 20:27.670
A nobleman's virtue

20:28.190 --> 20:29.550
requires utmost sincerity,

20:29.950 --> 20:31.190
righteousness,

20:31.590 --> 20:32.990
and compassion.

20:33.550 --> 20:36.190
Cultivate your virtue
before your character.

20:36.670 --> 20:38.670
Virtue enlightens the mind.

20:38.910 --> 20:41.670
Then set your purpose,

20:41.910 --> 20:43.910
unshaken by external things.

20:45.640 --> 20:46.310
How's that?

20:46.470 --> 20:47.750
Father, I'm good, right?

20:48.790 --> 20:49.750
First time seeing

20:50.070 --> 20:50.750
a woman

20:50.790 --> 20:51.590
calling you father.

20:52.390 --> 20:53.670
What's it feel like?

20:53.990 --> 20:54.510
Your daughter

20:54.510 --> 20:55.470
recites texts well.

20:55.710 --> 20:56.630
Quite clever indeed.

20:56.950 --> 20:57.740
- If I...
- Shut up.

20:59.150 --> 21:00.910
Father, you told me to shut up

21:01.470 --> 21:03.430
because I didn't recite it well enough?

21:04.550 --> 21:05.670
I'm not your father.

21:09.310 --> 21:10.190
Father,

21:11.390 --> 21:13.510
you want to disown me?

21:13.950 --> 21:14.550
Father,

21:14.910 --> 21:16.150
I've been working so hard.

21:16.510 --> 21:17.710
I've never brought

21:17.790 --> 21:18.630
shame to our family.

21:19.430 --> 21:20.110
Father.

21:21.190 --> 21:22.120
Father.

21:22.470 --> 21:24.030
It seems when Miss He was at home,

21:24.390 --> 21:25.790
her father was extremely strict.

21:26.350 --> 21:27.430
That's why even when drunk,

21:27.430 --> 21:28.950
she still craves her father's praise.

21:29.830 --> 21:30.670
If you ask me,

21:30.950 --> 21:32.310
just praise her already, Huaijin.

21:32.790 --> 21:33.420
Better yet,

21:33.750 --> 21:34.630
give her a reward.

21:36.110 --> 21:36.790
A reward?

21:42.390 --> 21:42.910
Father,

21:43.350 --> 21:45.150
other classmates get rewards

21:45.190 --> 21:46.230
after being praised.

21:46.590 --> 21:47.270
Do I?

21:49.110 --> 21:50.230
What reward do you want?

22:03.500 --> 22:04.190
Not this.

22:06.660 --> 22:07.190
Give me.

22:08.310 --> 22:09.350
Why so harsh?

22:09.430 --> 22:10.430
Don't scare Miss He.

22:11.140 --> 22:12.310
By the way,

22:12.710 --> 22:13.670
she's got good taste.

22:14.070 --> 22:14.950
She immediately picked

22:14.950 --> 22:16.030
your most treasured thing.

22:19.150 --> 22:20.140
Have you seen enough?

22:21.610 --> 22:23.020
Don't. I'm here.

22:25.640 --> 22:26.390
Miss He,

22:26.750 --> 22:27.870
do you like this pendant?

22:28.550 --> 22:29.630
Yes.

22:30.430 --> 22:31.510
Then do you like Chu Zhao?

22:33.070 --> 22:35.140
Chu Zhao...

22:35.350 --> 22:35.990
Cheng Lisu.

22:37.430 --> 22:38.670
I'm doing this for your sake.

22:39.990 --> 22:40.550
Miss He,

22:40.870 --> 22:41.910
another question.

22:42.190 --> 22:43.270
Do you like Xiao Jue?

22:45.670 --> 22:46.310
Cheng Lisu!

22:46.990 --> 22:47.590
Fine. Got it.

22:47.750 --> 22:48.360
I'll shut up.

22:48.470 --> 22:49.060
I'm leaving.

22:49.230 --> 22:50.510
You... seize your chance.

23:01.230 --> 23:02.390
Yes.

23:06.150 --> 23:06.870
You like...

23:07.670 --> 23:08.230
what?

23:10.630 --> 23:11.550
Medicine.

23:13.910 --> 23:14.510
Waist?

23:32.750 --> 23:33.870
Has Lei Hou been

23:34.430 --> 23:35.030
found?

23:35.550 --> 23:37.150
Our scouts recently reported

23:37.390 --> 23:37.950
the two

23:37.990 --> 23:39.070
headed towards Que City.

23:39.230 --> 23:40.630
Probably returning to Wutuo.

23:41.070 --> 23:42.030
Recall the scouts.

23:42.310 --> 23:43.070
No need to follow.

23:43.550 --> 23:44.070
Also,

23:44.550 --> 23:45.590
send back

23:45.590 --> 23:46.310
the two corpses

23:46.550 --> 23:47.830
as proof of completion.

23:48.550 --> 23:49.150
Tell Master

23:49.790 --> 23:50.910
the Lei brothers are dead.

23:52.470 --> 23:53.070
Young Master,

23:53.310 --> 23:54.350
will he believe this?

23:54.990 --> 23:55.990
The Lei brothers

23:56.070 --> 23:57.670
are just expendable pawns.

23:58.310 --> 23:59.510
Master won't care.

24:00.750 --> 24:01.590
Chai Anxi

24:02.670 --> 24:03.910
is the real priority.

24:04.790 --> 24:06.630
But Chai Anxi cut contact himself,

24:07.070 --> 24:08.150
meaning he intends to hide.

24:08.430 --> 24:09.110
Tracking him down

24:09.230 --> 24:10.510
might take considerable time.

24:11.030 --> 24:12.830
Xiao Jue must be investigating this too.

24:13.390 --> 24:13.950
We can hardly

24:13.990 --> 24:15.030
outpace him.

24:15.390 --> 24:16.430
Why not let it be?

24:16.810 --> 24:17.990
If we closely watch Xiao Jue,

24:18.120 --> 24:19.510
we'll find Chai Anxi eventually.

24:20.230 --> 24:20.950
If Xiao Jue

24:20.990 --> 24:22.470
finds Chai Anxi first,

24:23.030 --> 24:24.110
we'll lose the initiative.

24:24.790 --> 24:26.510
But Xiao Jue's position

24:26.950 --> 24:28.430
limits his freedom of action.

24:28.950 --> 24:30.390
We can seize opportunities

24:30.710 --> 24:32.190
and find Chai Anxi before he does.

24:32.990 --> 24:34.340
What about Miss He?

24:34.340 --> 24:35.270
Should we watch her?

24:35.950 --> 24:37.150
She's close to Xiao Jue

24:37.430 --> 24:38.790
and likely knows a lot.

24:39.310 --> 24:39.910
No need.

24:40.670 --> 24:41.390
She's invited me

24:41.390 --> 24:42.830
to drink in Mount Baiyue.

24:44.790 --> 24:45.430
I'll try

24:45.830 --> 24:47.110
to get information out of her.

25:32.990 --> 25:33.670
Enter.

25:37.390 --> 25:37.960
You're awake?

25:40.430 --> 25:41.540
You reek of alcohol.

25:41.830 --> 25:42.390
Here.

25:42.550 --> 25:43.230
I

25:43.310 --> 25:44.550
prepared hangover soup for you.

25:45.030 --> 25:45.590
Thank you.

25:46.510 --> 25:47.270
Seems you are

25:47.310 --> 25:48.390
fond of this jade pendant.

25:48.750 --> 25:49.750
Still clutching it now.

25:52.190 --> 25:52.910
Mr. Cheng,

25:53.630 --> 25:55.510
I didn't do anything inappropriate

25:55.550 --> 25:56.550
last night, did I?

25:56.750 --> 25:57.670
Of course not.

25:57.710 --> 25:58.630
You behaved well.

25:59.950 --> 26:00.990
You just let Huaijin

26:01.110 --> 26:01.870
experience

26:01.950 --> 26:03.390
how it feels to be a father

26:03.510 --> 26:04.550
and have a good daughter

26:04.590 --> 26:05.430
at such a young age.

26:07.590 --> 26:08.470
Father.

26:09.110 --> 26:10.070
I'm not your father.

26:10.550 --> 26:11.230
You remember now?

26:14.470 --> 26:15.190
Hold it tight.

26:16.030 --> 26:16.750
This is the reward

26:16.750 --> 26:17.470
after you recited

26:17.750 --> 26:19.150
the Virtue chapter.

26:20.150 --> 26:20.990
Reward?

26:25.590 --> 26:26.790
I snatched this, didn't I?

26:28.230 --> 26:28.750
Miss He,

26:28.990 --> 26:29.910
you're amazing.

26:30.230 --> 26:31.110
After all these years,

26:31.470 --> 26:32.510
this is the first time

26:32.590 --> 26:33.230
I've seen him

26:33.390 --> 26:34.110
in such a state.

26:34.710 --> 26:35.550
Having

26:35.590 --> 26:36.840
his most precious thing taken

26:36.950 --> 26:38.090
and having to hold the bag.

26:39.150 --> 26:40.170
His most precious thing?

26:43.150 --> 26:43.950
Don't tell me

26:44.950 --> 26:45.910
I actually

26:47.070 --> 26:48.070
took liberties with him?

26:48.270 --> 26:49.070
Of course not.

26:49.070 --> 26:49.990
What's wrong with you?

26:50.990 --> 26:52.630
Huaijin is...

26:55.830 --> 26:57.230
I'm talking about this pendant.

26:58.950 --> 26:59.750
This jade pendant

26:59.910 --> 27:01.270
was originally black and white,

27:01.750 --> 27:03.030
part of my grandaunt's dowry.

27:03.630 --> 27:04.230
Later,

27:04.510 --> 27:06.230
she had it split into two pieces

27:06.830 --> 27:07.790
and gave the white piece

27:07.990 --> 27:08.830
to his elder brother

27:09.270 --> 27:10.710
and the black one to Huaijin.

27:12.230 --> 27:12.950
I've heard

27:13.350 --> 27:14.430
his brother's piece

27:14.630 --> 27:15.990
is now with his sister-in-law.

27:16.710 --> 27:17.950
Then Huaijin's piece...

27:19.270 --> 27:20.390
Oh no, oh no.

27:20.910 --> 27:21.470
Last time,

27:21.470 --> 27:22.470
I destroyed his qin.

27:22.710 --> 27:23.390
This time, I took

27:23.470 --> 27:24.710
his future wife's pendant.

27:25.670 --> 27:26.790
I must return it!

27:28.150 --> 27:28.990
Your soup!

27:29.030 --> 27:29.790
You eat it!

27:32.100 --> 27:33.750
I'm doing good things

27:34.150 --> 27:36.070
without seeking glory.

27:55.190 --> 27:55.990
Morning, Commander.

28:04.150 --> 28:04.710
Commander.

28:09.950 --> 28:11.430
Are you attending to

28:12.110 --> 28:12.870
your duties?

28:14.590 --> 28:15.310
Get to the point.

28:17.700 --> 28:18.220
Yeah.

28:20.670 --> 28:21.450
Commander,

28:21.450 --> 28:22.510
last night,

28:22.670 --> 28:24.350
I was drunk. Completely wasted.

28:24.790 --> 28:25.550
So

28:25.670 --> 28:26.510
everything I said

28:26.750 --> 28:28.150
was pure nonsense.

28:28.510 --> 28:29.870
I shouldn't call you father

28:30.190 --> 28:31.670
or take your belongings.

28:34.470 --> 28:35.030
Commander,

28:35.270 --> 28:36.270
please be magnanimous

28:36.590 --> 28:37.590
and spare me this time.

28:37.950 --> 28:39.470
You're like my second parent.

28:41.470 --> 28:42.020
No.

28:42.750 --> 28:43.590
No.

28:43.750 --> 28:44.590
I mean

28:45.230 --> 28:46.430
your grace rebuilds my life.

28:47.550 --> 28:48.150
Commander,

28:48.550 --> 28:49.390
Mr. Chu has come.

28:52.670 --> 28:53.350
Let him in.

28:58.950 --> 28:59.910
Drink less.

29:00.390 --> 29:01.070
You're part

29:01.110 --> 29:01.950
of the battalion.

29:02.590 --> 29:03.910
Calling me like that

29:06.110 --> 29:06.830
is bad enough.

29:07.710 --> 29:08.470
Don't lose face

29:08.910 --> 29:09.710
in front of others.

29:10.310 --> 29:10.840
Yeah.

29:16.190 --> 29:16.830
Commander Xiao.

29:18.310 --> 29:18.870
Mr. He.

29:20.790 --> 29:21.350
Mr. Chu.

29:23.350 --> 29:24.070
What brings

29:24.430 --> 29:25.110
you here?

29:25.430 --> 29:26.670
I came for Mr. He.

29:27.070 --> 29:28.390
I couldn't find him

29:28.390 --> 29:29.030
in his quarters.

29:29.510 --> 29:30.990
Then I heard he was with you,

29:31.350 --> 29:33.190
so I came to visit.

29:34.910 --> 29:35.660
I never thought

29:35.910 --> 29:37.390
you were the impatient type.

29:39.950 --> 29:42.150
After all, Mr. He and I go way back.

29:45.070 --> 29:45.670
Is that so?

29:46.230 --> 29:47.660
You're here for me, Mr. Chu?

29:48.110 --> 29:48.670
Yes.

29:49.230 --> 29:50.950
After hearing you describe Mount Baiyue,

29:51.110 --> 29:52.390
I became quite enamored.

29:52.630 --> 29:54.150
Pity our plan fell through last night.

29:54.670 --> 29:56.390
Will you have time tonight

29:56.550 --> 29:57.350
to go there with me?

29:57.750 --> 29:58.470
No problem.

30:01.910 --> 30:02.440
Commander.

30:02.550 --> 30:03.470
I'll take my leave now.

30:34.910 --> 30:35.500
Commander.

30:38.270 --> 30:39.270
We found Chai Anxi.

30:42.350 --> 30:43.190
Traces of Chai Anxi

30:43.230 --> 30:44.230
were found in Jiyang.

30:47.190 --> 30:47.720
Yingxiang.

30:48.270 --> 30:48.830
Pack up.

30:49.070 --> 30:49.790
Let's depart now.

30:50.550 --> 30:51.830
We'll kill him before Xiao Jue

30:52.230 --> 30:53.070
arrives.

30:53.390 --> 30:53.930
Understood.

30:56.990 --> 30:57.590
Young Master.

30:58.030 --> 30:59.470
Are you writing to Chancellor Xu?

30:59.990 --> 31:00.520
No.

31:01.030 --> 31:02.110
This is for Miss He.

31:02.790 --> 31:03.670
I need to write her

31:04.150 --> 31:05.070
an apology

31:05.510 --> 31:06.390
for breaking my word.

31:08.430 --> 31:09.550
Shall I send someone

31:09.630 --> 31:10.630
to Mount Baiyue

31:11.110 --> 31:12.030
to deliver it to her

31:12.790 --> 31:13.590
in case she waits?

31:14.070 --> 31:15.390
I'll hand this letter to Xiao Jue

31:15.710 --> 31:16.750
when I bid him farewell

31:17.190 --> 31:18.070
for delivery.

31:18.470 --> 31:19.950
Are you testing Xiao Jue's reactions?

31:20.270 --> 31:21.030
Xiao Jue

31:21.070 --> 31:22.670
knows Miss He's true identity

31:22.830 --> 31:23.830
but helps conceal it.

31:24.510 --> 31:26.070
Perhaps he harbors feelings for her.

31:30.870 --> 31:32.230
Calling me like that

31:33.830 --> 31:34.590
is bad enough.

31:34.910 --> 31:35.990
Don't lose face in front of

31:36.030 --> 31:36.750
others.

31:37.510 --> 31:38.550
I've already tested him.

31:39.910 --> 31:40.710
Our abrupt departure

31:41.270 --> 31:42.550
will raise Xiao Jue's doubts.

31:43.350 --> 31:44.070
This letter

31:44.550 --> 31:45.990
will keep him occupied.

31:46.950 --> 31:47.510
It may

31:48.430 --> 31:49.870
(To He Yan)
buy us some time.

31:51.230 --> 31:52.350
(To He Yan)
I knew he had

31:52.390 --> 31:53.070
ulterior motives.

31:53.590 --> 31:54.670
A decree delivery?

31:54.990 --> 31:56.070
Actually he was probing

31:56.150 --> 31:56.870
for Xu Jingfu.

31:57.470 --> 31:58.830
Now, he must've heard something,

31:59.230 --> 32:00.270
going to Jiyang overnight.

32:02.550 --> 32:03.300
This is

32:03.710 --> 32:04.710
within my expectations.

32:05.230 --> 32:06.390
As a military officer,

32:06.870 --> 32:08.070
without imperial orders

32:08.110 --> 32:09.110
or urgent matters,

32:09.510 --> 32:10.470
I can't just leave.

32:11.470 --> 32:12.030
Moreover,

32:13.150 --> 32:14.390
our family has some history

32:14.550 --> 32:15.390
with Princess Mengji.

32:16.710 --> 32:17.990
We must act cautiously.

32:21.190 --> 32:21.950
Luckily, Jiyang,

32:22.550 --> 32:23.710
though under Wei's rule,

32:24.750 --> 32:26.390
operates autonomously.

32:26.870 --> 32:28.350
With Princess Mengji holding power,

32:29.230 --> 32:29.910
outsiders

32:30.550 --> 32:31.590
without connections

32:32.390 --> 32:33.670
find themselves constrained.

32:34.550 --> 32:36.110
He won't locate Chai Anxi quickly.

32:36.830 --> 32:37.350
Feinu,

32:38.390 --> 32:39.310
hurry up and arrange

32:39.950 --> 32:40.790
the identity change.

32:41.950 --> 32:42.470
Yes.

32:46.550 --> 32:47.510
- Feinu.
- Mr. Cheng.

32:48.390 --> 32:48.940
Huaijin.

32:49.190 --> 32:50.910
I just saw Chu Zhao leave.

32:51.310 --> 32:51.910
He's supposed

32:51.950 --> 32:53.230
to meet Miss He today, isn't he?

32:53.790 --> 32:54.390
He definitely

32:54.430 --> 32:56.190
hasn't made it to the meeting yet.

32:56.190 --> 32:56.790
Huaijin.

32:57.030 --> 32:58.270
This is a good opportunity.

32:58.870 --> 32:59.880
If Miss He

32:59.880 --> 33:01.060
truly has feelings for him,

33:01.350 --> 33:02.590
and now he broke their plan...

33:03.230 --> 33:04.070
Miss He

33:04.230 --> 33:05.470
is still a girl after all.

33:05.750 --> 33:07.070
She is delicate and sensitive.

33:07.350 --> 33:07.870
Now,

33:07.990 --> 33:09.150
she needs companionship.

33:09.710 --> 33:11.350
If you offer her gentle consolation,

33:11.790 --> 33:13.350
you'll surely win her favor.

33:15.030 --> 33:16.270
She wants to see Chu Zhao.

33:24.830 --> 33:26.980
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

33:27.090 --> 33:31.010
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

33:31.180 --> 33:33.130
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

33:33.220 --> 33:38.150
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

33:50.250 --> 33:51.650
♪I've seen the mountains♪

33:51.850 --> 33:53.270
♪And trodden through ice♪

33:53.540 --> 33:56.350
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

33:56.660 --> 33:58.050
♪Destiny is my creed♪

33:58.110 --> 33:59.510
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

33:59.650 --> 34:01.450
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

34:02.650 --> 34:04.120
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

34:04.290 --> 34:05.580
♪Gazing through the mire♪

34:05.750 --> 34:08.150
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

34:08.340 --> 34:10.389
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

34:11.530 --> 34:13.360
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

34:15.320 --> 34:18.239
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

34:18.330 --> 34:20.989
♪There must always be a longing♪

34:21.440 --> 34:26.510
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

34:26.840 --> 34:28.850
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

34:29.159 --> 34:32.810
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

34:33.050 --> 34:34.940
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

34:34.969 --> 34:38.820
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

34:39.170 --> 34:41.110
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

34:41.290 --> 34:45.110
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

34:45.370 --> 34:51.120
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

34:52.010 --> 34:57.480
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪

35:04.630 --> 35:07.550
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

35:07.640 --> 35:10.310
♪There must always be a longing♪

35:10.760 --> 35:15.820
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

35:16.150 --> 35:18.160
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

35:18.480 --> 35:22.120
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

35:22.360 --> 35:24.250
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

35:24.280 --> 35:28.130
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

